22.020" end="00:22.770">went</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.920" end="00:26.430"><span begin="00:22.920" end="00:23.220">Now </span><span begin="00:23.220" end="00:23.610">we </span><span begin="00:23.610" end="00:24.540">are </span><span begin="00:24.540" end="00:24.780">just </span><span begin="00:24.780" end="00:25.170">past </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:26.430">tense</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.700" end="00:29.850"><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:26.940">And </span><span begin="00:26.940" end="00:27.090">the </span><span begin="00:27.090" end="00:27.720">snakes' </span><span begin="00:27.720" end="00:27.900">they </span><span begin="00:27.900" end="00:27.990">are </span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.860">slithering </span><span begin="00:28.860" end="00:29.850">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.060" end="00:32.370"><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.960">Chasing </span><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:31.260">me </span><span begin="00:31.260" end="00:31.500">to </span><span begin="00:31.500" end="00:31.950">my </span><span begin="00:31.950" end="00:32.370">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.400" end="00:35.160"><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.490">I </span><span begin="00:32.490" end="00:32.850">can't </span><span begin="00:32.850" end="00:33.750">say </span><span begin="00:33.750" end="00:34.050">where </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:34.470">that </span><span begin="00:34.470" end="00:35.160">is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.370" end="00:38.040"><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:35.640">I'm </span><span begin="00:35.640" end="00:37.140">running </span><span begin="00:37.140" end="00:38.040">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.160" end="00:40.170"><span begin="00:38.160" end="00:38.490">And </span><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:38.820">when </span><span begin="00:38.820" end="00:39.030">I </span><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.480">get </span><span begin="00:39.480" end="00